+// Ported from jet_cad_floor_plan/test/host/table_overlay_test.dart;
+// assertions unchanged.
+//
+// Ports TO1-TO12, TO15-TO22, TO24-TO31 and TO33. Left to Part B (they need
+// the design canvas or the mode switch inside one widget, `PlanEditor`):
+// TO13, TO14, TO23, and TO32 (its layer toggle is a structure command,
+// refused on the service copy, so it runs on the design's canvas).
+//
+// Host embedding API spec, Slice 1, G-5, G-6, G-7 and H-8 (2b spec S4
+// "Unit overlays"): the host's widgets on the units
+// (`PlanServiceView.unitOverlayBuilder`), their placement
+// (`PlanOverlayLayout`), the detail levels, and the layer's cost
+// (`RenderPlanUnitOverlays`), over the shared non-degenerate fixture
+// (unit_embedding_fixture): an off-base box, units turned, mirrored and
+// scaled 40 m off the origin, a hidden and a locked layer, a shared label,
+// and a panned camera at 0.37 px/mm. Expected places are computed here by
+// the forward transform of the fixture's box, never read back from the
+// code.
